# Local-only Worker secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored) to test the gate.
# In production, set this with:  wrangler secret put CABIN_PASSPHRASE
#
# Leave unset/empty to disable the access gate entirely (app is fully open — the default).
CABIN_PASSPHRASE="change-me-to-a-strong-passphrase"
